# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (—) in anything written for this project: page copy, titles, meta tags, JSON-LD, llms.txt, comments, or commit messages.

Before building a new feature, read every rule in `.cursor/rules/`.

Replace a pause with a period, comma, colon, or parentheses.

```
Bad: Labels — Made in Bonnyville
Good: Labels. Made in Bonnyville

Bad: Yes — we ship a sample kit
Good: Yes. We ship a sample kit
```
